  "text": "Recipe: Ghiya Fritters\nCreator: Mayank Chattree\nCategory: Snack\nIngredients: 1 medium size bottle gourd, ½ cup whole black gram flour, 2 Tbsp flaxseed powder, 3 tsp chia seeds, ⅓ cup rolled oats, 4 to 6 baby carrots, 2 sprigs cilantro, 2 Thai chili, ½ Tbsp coriander powder, ½ tsp red chilli powder, 1 tsp Garam Masala, 1 tsp khatai, Salt\nCooking methods: blend, bake\nInstructions: 1) Blend all ingredients in the food processor at low speed. Make sure that the mixture is slightly coarse, and not watery or runny.\n2) Scoop approx. 2-inch diameter dollops of the mixture onto non-stick foil. Bake for 7 mins at 350 F. Then flip them over with a silicone spatula and bake at 325 F for 9 mins or so.\nNotes: (a) We may adjust timing and temperature based on our oven, and the degree of crispiness we prefer.",
